WEBVTT

00:00:10.620 --> 00:00:15.680
If your wish ever comes true,

00:00:10.620 --> 00:00:15.680
君の願いが叶うその時

00:00:10.620 --> 00:00:15.680
Kimi no negai ga kanau sono toki

00:00:15.690 --> 00:00:24.130
then go ahead and assume that my dream has also come true.

00:00:15.690 --> 00:00:24.130
私の夢も叶うと信じて

00:00:15.690 --> 00:00:24.130
Watashi no yume mo kanau to shinjite

00:00:24.500 --> 00:00:30.290
Kenichi

00:00:24.500 --> 00:00:30.290
SubDESU

00:00:26.160 --> 00:00:30.290
History's Strongest Disciple

00:00:26.160 --> 00:00:30.290
Presents

00:00:30.430 --> 00:00:35.320
I know that you have been choosing,

00:00:30.430 --> 00:00:35.320
いつだって遠回りする道を

00:00:30.430 --> 00:00:35.320
Itsudatte toomawari suru michi wo

00:00:35.330 --> 00:00:40.050
roundabout paths constantly.

00:00:35.330 --> 00:00:40.050
選び続けたことも知ってる

00:00:35.330 --> 00:00:40.050
Erabi tsuduketa koto mo shitteru

00:00:40.060 --> 00:00:45.080
I also know how you always try to smile,

00:00:40.060 --> 00:00:45.080
誰よりも傷ついてる時でも

00:00:40.060 --> 00:00:45.080
Dare yori mo kizutsuiteru toki de mo

00:00:45.100 --> 00:00:51.330
even though it's you who's hurt the most!

00:00:45.100 --> 00:00:51.330
笑ってみせることも私は知ってる

00:00:45.100 --> 00:00:51.330
Waratte miseru koto mo watashi wa shitteru

00:00:51.340 --> 00:00:54.980
I then look up,

00:00:51.340 --> 00:00:54.980
何も言わず星を

00:00:51.340 --> 00:00:54.980
Nani mo iwazu hoshi wo

00:00:54.990 --> 00:00:58.850
gazing silently at the stars...

00:00:54.990 --> 00:00:58.850
見つめてるとなり ...

00:00:54.990 --> 00:00:58.850
Mitsumeteru to nari ...

00:00:58.860 --> 00:01:02.330
祈るを捧ぐ

00:00:58.860 --> 00:01:02.330
Inoru wo sasagu

00:00:58.890 --> 00:01:02.330
And offer my prayer.

00:01:02.340 --> 00:01:07.390
If your wish ever comes true,

00:01:02.340 --> 00:01:07.390
君の願いが叶うその時

00:01:02.340 --> 00:01:07.390
Kimi no negai ga kanau sono toki

00:01:07.400 --> 00:01:12.320
my tears would definitely end up spilling.

00:01:07.400 --> 00:01:12.320
私の涙こぼれるでしょう

00:01:07.400 --> 00:01:12.320
Watashi no namida koboreru deshou

00:01:12.330 --> 00:01:16.850
No matter when, I will always look at you

00:01:12.330 --> 00:01:16.850
どんな時でも見つめてるよ

00:01:12.330 --> 00:01:16.850
Donna toki de mo mitsumeteru yo

00:01:16.860 --> 00:01:23.220
because it's you who taught me the power of belief.

00:01:16.860 --> 00:01:23.220
信じる強さ教えてくれた

00:01:16.860 --> 00:01:23.220
Shinjiru tsuyosa oshiete kureta

00:01:38.980 --> 00:01:43.360
Conviction concentrated in one's fist

00:01:39.420 --> 00:01:41.250
Let's finish this game of hide and seek already.

00:01:41.770 --> 00:01:45.880
I request for a formal martial arts duel with you all– err...

00:01:46.240 --> 00:01:48.730
Quit it with that god awful ruckus!

00:01:48.730 --> 00:01:51.220
Let me drink my booze peacefully for once, will ya?!

00:01:53.540 --> 00:01:55.400
<i>What a tremendous aura.</i>

00:02:03.140 --> 00:02:04.850
<i>Carving only the boots off...</i>

00:02:04.850 --> 00:02:06.350
<i>What amazing dexterity!</i>

