00:02:20.020 --> 00:02:21.740
<i>These guys are not to be taken lightly.</i>

00:02:22.160 --> 00:02:24.450
I am Boris Ivanov of Yomi.

00:02:24.450 --> 00:02:28.000
I've come to conquer this <i>dojo</i> under the orders of Yami.

00:02:28.000 --> 00:02:29.490
What, did you just say Yami?

00:02:29.490 --> 00:02:31.720
Well, that's not good.

00:02:32.470 --> 00:02:35.010
<i>I didn't even sense him behind me! </i>

00:02:36.930 --> 00:02:39.490
For starters, allow us to return your friends.

00:02:39.490 --> 00:02:41.460
It wasn't the newspaper delivery guy,

00:02:41.460 --> 00:02:42.770
but this bunch who got caught in the trap.

00:02:43.370 --> 00:02:46.020
Just who are you people?

00:02:46.310 --> 00:02:49.970
I don't think that's a question an intruder should be asking.

00:02:49.970 --> 00:02:52.030
Didn't you see the sign outside?

00:02:52.400 --> 00:02:54.050
This is the Ryouzanpaku.

00:02:54.050 --> 00:02:56.950
A place that houses martial arts masters from all walks of life.

00:02:57.140 --> 00:02:59.980
Wh-What? It isn't Hakuzan...?

00:02:59.980 --> 00:03:02.200
I see, so it's Ryouzanpaku.

00:03:02.200 --> 00:03:03.700
This is the rumored Ryouzanpaku!

00:03:06.490 --> 00:03:07.760
<i>The sworn enemy of Yami.</i>

00:03:07.760 --> 00:03:10.630
<i>A place where the strongest disciple is being trained.</i>

00:03:10.630 --> 00:03:11.460
<i>It's that place–</i>

00:03:12.310 --> 00:03:14.470
So you did indeed barge in here being oblivious to that fact, didn't you?

00:03:14.710 --> 00:03:18.270
Hmph, it doesn't matter I'll still complete my mission.

00:03:18.500 --> 00:03:20.580
Come at me, Ryouzanpaku!

00:03:21.060 --> 00:03:24.230
This is bad, the situation is getting out of hand.

00:03:24.500 --> 00:03:25.930
You sure have guts there.

00:03:26.100 --> 00:03:27.380
Apa.

00:03:30.650 --> 00:03:31.640
Time out.

00:03:35.800 --> 00:03:37.560
This is getting really bothersome.

00:03:37.860 --> 00:03:39.080
Why so?

00:03:39.080 --> 00:03:40.300
You don't get it?

00:03:40.300 --> 00:03:42.400
If <i>we</i>  defeat Yami's disciple right now,

00:03:42.400 --> 00:03:44.420
it would spark an all-out conflict.

00:03:45.400 --> 00:03:46.680
Is it that bad?

00:03:46.700 --> 00:03:47.580
Is it that bad?

00:03:48.250 --> 00:03:50.330
Look at his eyes.

00:03:53.080 --> 00:03:53.740
Those eyes,

00:03:53.740 --> 00:03:56.440
they're the eyes of someone whose already prepared to die.

00:03:56.790 --> 00:03:58.510
Yes, it's really plastered on him.

00:03:59.900 --> 00:04:03.830
Those are the same eyes that my opponent and I used to have when we fought in the ring.

00:04:03.830 --> 00:04:06.100
He wasn't thrown off by my aura either.

00:04:06.100 --> 00:04:08.970
Quite admirable, even though he's the enemy's disciple.

00:04:09.280 --> 00:04:11.880
Our disciple on the other hand...

00:04:12.880 --> 00:04:14.240
I'm going to escape, wooo!~

00:04:13.680 --> 00:04:15.010
I see.

00:04:13.810 --> 00:04:16.610
fluttering

00:04:13.810 --> 00:04:16.610
I'm going to escape wooo!~

00:04:14.240 --> 00:04:16.480
Farewell!~

00:04:15.010 --> 00:04:16.460
Then we have to buy some time.

00:04:16.460 --> 00:04:17.730
Alright leave it to me.

00:04:17.730 --> 00:04:21.640
I'm going to crush him a bit and then send him home.

00:04:22.140 --> 00:04:23.530
Like hell you are!

00:04:23.630 --> 00:04:24.330
Sit your ass down!

00:04:24.330 --> 00:04:25.030
Apa?

00:04:25.030 --> 00:04:27.040
You mustn't fight him.

00:04:27.440 --> 00:04:28.630
Apa!

00:04:28.630 --> 00:04:29.600
<i>An opening!</i>

00:04:42.380 --> 00:04:50.590
Well, why don't we hear what you really want first? We're going to fight properly after that.

00:04:51.420 --> 00:04:52.390
<i>He spoke in Russian!</i>

00:04:52.970 --> 00:04:55.570
<i>As expected of our resident tea ceremony expert.</i>

00:04:55.570 --> 00:04:58.570
<i>Anyone who drinks his tea will calm down, softening themselves up no matter what.</i>

00:04:58.570 --> 00:05:01.890
<i>A preemptive peaceful strike that would potentially make him leave without risking any disastrous consequences.</i>

00:05:02.240 --> 00:05:07.660
<i>Turns out that Ken-chan's absence due to his desperation to escape turned out to be a blessing in disguise.</i>

00:05:07.970 --> 00:05:11.100
<i>That Yami's disciple seems to have seen his share of hell.</i>

00:05:11.100 --> 00:05:13.260
Is there something that you don't like or disagree with?

00:05:13.260 --> 00:05:14.720
<i>Ken-chan in his current state wouldn't be able to–</i>

00:05:14.720 --> 00:05:16.360
I'm home!

00:05:16.360 --> 00:05:19.130
Oh, Kenichi-san, you're home already?

00:05:19.520 --> 00:05:20.890
Masters!

00:05:20.890 --> 00:05:24.180
I, Kenichi Shirahama, disciple number one, have finally returned.

00:05:21.420 --> 00:05:23.900
<i>Oh, I think they have guests inside the dojo right now...</i>

00:05:23.960 --> 00:05:25.060
<i>A disciple?</i>

00:05:24.510 --> 00:05:25.060
That's...

00:05:25.060 --> 00:05:27.380
I've recovered already.

00:05:26.180 --> 00:05:31.140
*grip**grip*

00:05:26.180 --> 00:05:31.140
*twist**twist*

00:05:27.370 --> 00:05:28.380
I've properly returned,

00:05:28.380 --> 00:05:31.180
so I hope there'll be no punishment for this.

00:05:31.180 --> 00:05:32.270
And so,

00:05:32.270 --> 00:05:34.510
I hope to restart training as soon as possible please!

00:05:34.510 --> 00:05:35.740
Starting now,

00:05:35.740 --> 00:05:39.120
I'm going to train very hard again to become the strongest disciple!

00:05:39.120 --> 00:05:40.850
The strongest disciple?!

00:05:41.170 --> 00:05:41.940
Oh no!

00:05:45.990 --> 00:05:46.700
Watch out!

00:05:47.890 --> 00:05:49.230
Don't cover him, Miu!

00:05:49.230 --> 00:05:50.490
Counter with both your hands!

00:05:54.270 --> 00:05:55.330
Miu-san!

00:06:06.680 --> 00:06:09.510
You instantly changed your stance with just one move.

00:06:09.510 --> 00:06:10.550
Quite impressive.

00:06:11.270 --> 00:06:12.550
However!

00:06:12.930 --> 00:06:13.690
You bastard!

00:06:13.690 --> 00:06:14.430
Don't.

00:06:14.910 --> 00:06:16.770
It has begun.

00:06:16.770 --> 00:06:19.190
It's now a battle between disciples.

00:06:19.640 --> 00:06:20.870
Miu-san!

00:06:21.450 --> 00:06:23.240
I lowered my guard.

00:06:23.240 --> 00:06:26.370
But... I blocked it enough to negate the majority of the intended damage,

00:06:26.370 --> 00:06:28.210
so it's nothing life-threatening.

00:06:28.900 --> 00:06:29.800
You!

00:06:29.800 --> 00:06:30.540
Who the hell are you?!

00:06:30.860 --> 00:06:32.840
My name is Boris Ivanov.

00:06:32.840 --> 00:06:35.350
A member of Yomi, a disciple group of Yami.

00:06:35.350 --> 00:06:39.210
And the number one disciple of Alexander of the One Shadow Nine Fists.

00:06:39.540 --> 00:06:40.970
One Shadow Nine Fists.

00:06:40.970 --> 00:06:42.210
I thought so.

00:06:42.510 --> 00:06:43.960
This bastard...

00:06:43.960 --> 00:06:47.560
Barged into the Ryouzanpaku while I was gone,

00:06:47.560 --> 00:06:51.340
and hurt the one who is most important to me!

00:06:57.060 --> 00:06:58.840
<i>You musn't, Kenichi-kun!</i>

00:06:58.840 --> 00:07:02.250
<i>Your anger is swallowing your heart and mind!</i>

00:07:03.340 --> 00:07:06.560
This Yomi sure is filled with a bunch of sad and sorry people,

00:07:06.560 --> 00:07:09.940
for they can't see the use of martial arts for anything but violence. {m to just use martial arts for violence.}

00:07:10.280 --> 00:07:12.540
<i>He instantly suppressed his rapidly surging anger.</i>

00:07:12.920 --> 00:07:15.080
<i>Impressive application of self control.</i>

00:07:15.080 --> 00:07:16.440
<i>I'm a bit surprised.</i>

00:07:19.550 --> 00:07:22.220
<i>What the– His deadly aura just disappeared?</i>

00:07:22.220 --> 00:07:26.090
<i>It is now an aura the likes of which I have never felt from any fighter that I have engaged before.</i>

00:07:26.730 --> 00:07:30.580
<i>In any case, I'm surrounded by this many masters,</i>

00:07:30.580 --> 00:07:32.580
<i>I can no longer afford to walk out of here alive.</i>

00:07:32.920 --> 00:07:34.230
<i>Then at the very least,</i>

00:07:34.230 --> 00:07:37.190
<i>I need to bring this powerful disciple down to hell with me.</i>

00:07:37.190 --> 00:07:40.570
<i>I shall accomplish my mission using my special killing move!</i>

00:07:43.140 --> 00:07:44.220
<i>I got him!</i>

00:07:45.360 --> 00:07:48.180
The Death God's Ring!

00:07:46.960 --> 00:07:49.640
The Death God's Ring!

00:07:49.820 --> 00:07:50.860
Oh no!

00:07:50.860 --> 00:07:52.860
It was Command SAMBO after all!

00:07:52.860 --> 00:07:54.570
Is it bad?

00:07:54.570 --> 00:07:55.460
Yes.

00:07:55.730 --> 00:08:01.420
It's a killing fighting style that combines Russian grappling techniques and SAMBO.

00:08:01.960 --> 00:08:04.920
It widely surfaced during Russia's period of perestroika,

00:08:04.920 --> 00:08:07.170
and was even taught within the KGB.

00:08:07.170 --> 00:08:10.720
It was developed with the simple purpose of annihilating the opponent.

00:08:10.720 --> 00:08:12.400
That <i>is</i>  bad!

00:08:12.930 --> 00:08:14.140
This is the end.

00:08:14.140 --> 00:08:16.350
Die, the strongest disciple.

00:08:19.470 --> 00:08:20.340
Hm?

00:08:23.330 --> 00:08:25.660
Isn't that one of the Karate's breathing technique?!

00:08:25.660 --> 00:08:28.120
He seems to be compiling and refining his inner <i>Ki</i>.

00:08:28.440 --> 00:08:30.480
A futile resistance. Just die!

00:08:36.120 --> 00:08:37.310
My, oh my.

00:08:37.310 --> 00:08:38.830
Shirahama Kenichi.

00:08:38.830 --> 00:08:42.360
You absolutely have no special martial arts talent.

00:08:46.930 --> 00:08:50.350
Instead what we are witnessing right now is the result of rigorous hard work and training,

00:08:50.350 --> 00:08:52.770
which is sprouting at this critical moment.

00:08:53.080 --> 00:08:54.520
I-Impossible!

00:08:54.520 --> 00:08:57.890
How much strength is hidden in that thin arm of yours?!

00:08:58.250 --> 00:08:59.980
Quality over quantity my friend.

00:08:59.980 --> 00:09:01.690
Impulse and stamina.

00:09:01.690 --> 00:09:03.380
Both of these qualities were developed exclusively

00:09:03.380 --> 00:09:06.890
in conjunction with his natural physique,

00:09:06.890 --> 00:09:08.810
to maximize his natural combat proficiency.

00:09:08.810 --> 00:09:12.630
This move should have been fatal for a normal human.

00:09:12.630 --> 00:09:14.520
His respiratory tract should have ruptured instantaneously!

00:09:14.860 --> 00:09:16.180
His internal organs, you see,

00:09:16.180 --> 00:09:18.000
were tempered with relentlessly

00:09:18.000 --> 00:09:22.480
from the day he started training so as to withstand intense amount of damage.

00:09:22.480 --> 00:09:24.810
He's also heavily trained in the Karate arts of body shifting.

00:09:24.810 --> 00:09:26.830
Squeezing certain joints and muscles, for example,

00:09:26.830 --> 00:09:29.010
to shield his internal organs deep within the rib cage

00:09:29.010 --> 00:09:30.300
among other things.

00:09:30.660 --> 00:09:36.050
Even I trained him solely in the dangerous art of absolute enemy annihilation.

00:09:39.260 --> 00:09:41.940
<i>SAMBO true combat elbow-technique form,</i>

00:09:41.940 --> 00:09:44.020
<i>combined with the foot-technique Command SAMBO.</i>

00:09:44.500 --> 00:09:46.500
<i>Gonna execute that high end move now!</i>

00:09:52.700 --> 00:09:54.360
TL Note: Refer to wiki for details.

00:09:52.700 --> 00:09:54.360
<i>Seikuken?</i>

00:09:54.360 --> 00:09:55.980
Then I am gonna start the chain from below!

00:09:59.480 --> 00:10:02.540
He evaded my initial strike?

00:10:02.540 --> 00:10:05.080
I don't really get angry much,

00:10:05.080 --> 00:10:08.630
but I will never forgive anyone who hurts Miu-san!

00:10:08.630 --> 00:10:10.130
I'm going to take you down!

00:10:13.040 --> 00:10:14.860
Kenichi-san.

00:10:14.860 --> 00:10:18.260
You've become quite splendid during the short time you were out there.

00:10:18.260 --> 00:10:23.640
Is that how an elder sister expresses her joy witnessing the growth of her clumsy younger brother?

00:10:23.640 --> 00:10:26.200
I'm going to apply first aid for you, okay?

00:10:26.270 --> 00:10:27.280
She doesn't need it.

00:10:27.280 --> 00:10:29.640
That level of aid is good enough.

00:10:30.270 --> 00:10:32.520
<i>Calm down, calm down Boris!</i>

00:10:32.520 --> 00:10:35.450
<i>The first one to panic on the battlefield loses!</i>

00:10:36.770 --> 00:10:39.660
No matter what happens, you must always maintain your calm, my student Boris.

00:11:04.360 --> 00:11:07.020
You've done well in calmly coming up with that proper reaction.

00:11:08.120 --> 00:11:10.190
Aside from throwing away your fear,

00:11:10.790 --> 00:11:12.840
you must also cast away emotions from your decisions.

00:11:12.840 --> 00:11:14.060
You must understand,

00:11:14.060 --> 00:11:16.060
that your real foe resides within you!

00:11:16.060 --> 00:11:17.530
Yes, my master!

00:11:18.250 --> 00:11:19.550
<i>That's right,</i>

00:11:19.550 --> 00:11:22.900
<i>let's start with a calm analysis, like I usually do.</i>

00:11:23.310 --> 00:11:24.830
<i>A normal looking gesture.</i>

00:11:24.830 --> 00:11:26.080
<i>The movements of his arms and legs,</i>

00:11:26.080 --> 00:11:27.370
<i>the center of gravity at his position.</i>

00:11:27.370 --> 00:11:28.810
<i>I must observe all of these,</i>

00:11:28.810 --> 00:11:30.120
<i>and come up with an analysis.</i>

00:11:30.120 --> 00:11:33.550
<i>That way I'll be able to see through his fighting prowess and find that weak spot!</i>

00:11:37.650 --> 00:11:38.770
<i>What's with this guy?</i>

00:11:39.180 --> 00:11:40.860
<i>This is strange.</i>

00:11:40.860 --> 00:11:42.580
<i>According to my analysis,</i>

00:11:42.580 --> 00:11:45.430
<i>he is nothing but a normal person.</i>

00:11:45.430 --> 00:11:48.060
<i>In a normal situation, he should have died by my hands more than twice already!</i>

00:11:48.430 --> 00:11:49.920
What’s wrong? Come on!

00:11:50.280 --> 00:11:52.660
<i>But he is still standing right there,</i>

00:11:52.660 --> 00:11:54.340
<i>and he's even taunting me to attack!</i>

00:11:54.340 --> 00:11:56.540
<i>It's as if I am being threatened by a small animal,</i>

00:11:56.540 --> 00:11:58.070
<i>that doesn't even have claws or fangs!</i>

00:11:59.230 --> 00:12:00.460
<i>Strange.</i>

00:12:00.460 --> 00:12:02.690
<i>It is indeed a strange situation!</i>

00:12:04.030 --> 00:12:05.540
<i>I can't fathom this!</i>

00:12:05.540 --> 00:12:07.040
<i>Die you small animal!</i>

00:12:13.360 --> 00:12:23.360
{- Eyecatch -}

00:12:26.440 --> 00:12:27.640
<i>This is strange.</i>

00:12:27.640 --> 00:12:29.400
<i>Why did I fall down?</i>

00:12:29.780 --> 00:12:32.390
Isn't that the Command SAMBO technique you just used?

00:12:32.920 --> 00:12:34.760
When the Command SAMBO's base form, the SAMBO,

00:12:34.760 --> 00:12:39.320
was developed with a combination of over two hundred martial arts across the world,

00:12:39.320 --> 00:12:42.910
Jujutsu was also one of the arts that touched SAMBO's evolution.

00:12:44.540 --> 00:12:45.900
Jujutsu you say?

00:12:47.540 --> 00:12:49.300
I'm going to take the offensive this time!

00:12:50.440 --> 00:12:51.370
I got you!

00:12:51.880 --> 00:12:54.150
All I have to do now is break your neck!

00:13:01.890 --> 00:13:03.650
<i>What incredible flexibility!</i>

00:13:03.650 --> 00:13:06.230
<i>And immense damaging power even through my protector pads...</i>

00:13:06.230 --> 00:13:08.620
<i>The strength of his legs is extraordinary!</i>

00:13:11.580 --> 00:13:12.570
That Russian,

00:13:12.570 --> 00:13:14.630
he was able to dodge that kick flawlessly.

00:13:14.630 --> 00:13:17.650
Indeed, simply put, no ordinary training could have brought him this far.

00:13:18.540 --> 00:13:22.720
The training imparted by Yami is rather superb.

00:13:29.850 --> 00:13:30.610
<i>I don't understand.</i>

00:13:31.040 --> 00:13:32.420
<i>It is beyond my comprehension!</i>

00:13:41.760 --> 00:13:43.690
<i>If he truly is a martial artist of this immense caliber,</i>

00:13:43.690 --> 00:13:45.960
<i>there has to be a set of absolute basis that defines his strength.</i>

00:13:46.520 --> 00:13:48.170
<i>Even members of Yomi are like that.</i>

00:13:48.170 --> 00:13:51.060
<i>Each and everyone of them hold their dark powers deep within them,</i>

00:13:51.060 --> 00:13:54.010
<i>yet they emanate it intensely through their eyes</i>

00:13:54.410 --> 00:13:58.260
<i>I was taught that greater strength is obtained through darkness.</i>

00:13:58.260 --> 00:14:01.800
<i>But there's not a single tint of darkness in his eyes.</i>

00:14:01.800 --> 00:14:04.540
<i>Rather, it feels like they're radiating with light!</i>

00:14:07.010 --> 00:14:08.520
They're quite evenly matched.

00:14:08.520 --> 00:14:10.840
There are at least ten disciples within our enemy's group,

00:14:10.840 --> 00:14:13.050
so in all honestly we are no where near "being even".

00:14:13.050 --> 00:14:15.330
Yes, I have got your kids.

00:14:15.770 --> 00:14:18.140
Huh? I'm Apachai of course.

00:14:18.140 --> 00:14:20.610
Yep, today is quite a pleasant day for me.

00:14:20.610 --> 00:14:23.590
Apachai, what are you talking about over the enemy's comm lines?

00:14:24.340 --> 00:14:26.380
Hey Boris Ivanov!

00:14:26.380 --> 00:14:27.180
Phone call for you!

00:14:27.180 --> 00:14:28.720
It's someone that claims to be your leader or something.

00:14:34.550 --> 00:14:35.610
Go ahead.

00:14:38.410 --> 00:14:40.550
Don't take too long.

00:14:42.950 --> 00:14:43.960
What?

00:14:43.960 --> 00:14:45.520
We have to retreat?

00:14:45.520 --> 00:14:47.430
That's right, I need you to retreat.

00:14:47.430 --> 00:14:48.520
Right now.

00:14:48.520 --> 00:14:52.780
If your man hadn't contacted me, things would have taken a turn for the worse, you know?

00:14:53.810 --> 00:14:56.820
Forgive me, I assessed that this was an emergency.

00:14:57.160 --> 00:14:59.310
I'm the middle of a match with the enemy!

00:14:59.310 --> 00:15:00.360
You...

00:15:00.360 --> 00:15:01.890
Do you want to be erased?

00:15:01.890 --> 00:15:03.290
Come back right now.

00:15:03.290 --> 00:15:04.840
This is an order.

00:15:05.190 --> 00:15:07.120
I'm currently surrounded by a couple of masters.

00:15:07.120 --> 00:15:08.400
Escape is going to be difficult.

00:15:08.400 --> 00:15:09.320
We don't mind.

00:15:09.320 --> 00:15:10.490
Just go home already.

00:15:10.490 --> 00:15:11.460
I heard that.

00:15:11.460 --> 00:15:12.670
Come back right now!

00:15:13.180 --> 00:15:14.180
chuckle

00:15:21.120 --> 00:15:24.680
I haven't heard your name yet, strongest disciple.

00:15:24.680 --> 00:15:26.140
My name is Shirahama.

00:15:26.140 --> 00:15:27.660
Shirahama Kenichi!

00:15:27.660 --> 00:15:28.700
I see.

00:15:28.700 --> 00:15:31.130
Strongest disciple Kenichi,

00:15:31.130 --> 00:15:34.010
I'm going to kill you and take back that emblem with me!

00:15:34.010 --> 00:15:36.360
It is an official declaration of a duel by Yomi!

00:15:38.520 --> 00:15:40.420
Hey! Time to move already you brats!

00:15:42.550 --> 00:15:43.820
Remember this:

00:15:43.820 --> 00:15:45.900
Your life is for me to take.

00:15:45.900 --> 00:15:48.140
What are you deciding things yourself for?

00:15:48.610 --> 00:15:49.900
Move out!

00:15:50.570 --> 00:15:51.860
Yes sir!

00:15:52.540 --> 00:15:53.400
Wait!

00:15:53.400 --> 00:15:54.550
Let them go.

00:15:54.550 --> 00:15:56.080
Why are you stopping me?

00:15:56.080 --> 00:15:58.430
He just hurt Miu-san!

00:15:58.430 --> 00:16:00.190
You don't understand?

00:16:00.500 --> 00:16:02.220
It has begun.

00:16:02.460 --> 00:16:06.070
An all out war between Yami and Ryouzanpaku has now begun.

00:16:08.650 --> 00:16:12.520
I never thought that a disciple of Yami would come this quickly to Ryopuzanpaku.

00:16:12.520 --> 00:16:14.710
Moreover, it was supposedly a coincidence?

00:16:14.710 --> 00:16:17.680
Now then, I wonder who pulled the strings to make this happen.

00:16:23.400 --> 00:16:26.680
A submarine has just surfaced in front of the ship!

00:16:26.680 --> 00:16:28.360
It's a Typhoon-class!

00:16:28.360 --> 00:16:29.710
Do not panic.

00:16:30.370 --> 00:16:31.450
So it's him, huh?

00:16:31.450 --> 00:16:33.570
I guess I need to welcome him myself.

00:16:38.840 --> 00:16:42.680
As always, its elegant interior makes me wonder if it's actually a submarine.

00:16:42.680 --> 00:16:45.560
You are indeed a genius, even in the world of art.

00:16:46.460 --> 00:16:49.280
Russia's greatest Command SAMBO user.

00:16:49.280 --> 00:16:52.700
Alexander Gaidar, the Fist of Destruction.

00:16:52.700 --> 00:16:54.220
Art is good.

00:16:54.220 --> 00:16:58.080
It is the only thing that tames my madness for combat.

00:17:00.920 --> 00:17:05.080
I ask you not to disturb this meager solace of my soul, Saint Fist.

00:17:05.420 --> 00:17:07.840
Oh, and what are you talking about exactly?

00:17:10.620 --> 00:17:13.750
Don't act dumb in front of me!

00:17:15.180 --> 00:17:19.960
The number of dojos listed in Yomi's dispatch list was supposed to be 58!

00:17:19.960 --> 00:17:25.160
But my disciple's list had a 59th dojo–!

00:17:25.480 --> 00:17:28.270
Oops, I did it again.

00:17:31.850 --> 00:17:36.880
You were part of the plan to direct my disciple Boris Ivanov to Ryouzanpaku, weren't you?

00:17:36.880 --> 00:17:40.130
I'm one of the youngest and most inexperienced members of Yami.

00:17:40.130 --> 00:17:44.410
I simply followed the path of Yomi, in the way Ichiei wanted to.

00:17:44.410 --> 00:17:49.290
Well, in the end your disciple was able to inflict the first attack on the battlefield anyway.

00:17:49.290 --> 00:17:51.620
Isn't that quite honorable?

00:17:51.620 --> 00:17:54.420
Your disciple came back safely anyway.

00:17:54.420 --> 00:17:56.800
<i>Oogata Isshinsai, the Saint Fist.</i>

00:17:57.110 --> 00:17:58.740
<i>A difficult man to deal with.</i>

00:18:01.250 --> 00:18:02.260
My, oh my.

00:18:04.950 --> 00:18:08.480
The equilibrium has now been broken.

00:18:10.140 --> 00:18:12.490
The battle shall now begin.

00:18:12.950 --> 00:18:15.080
I'm to quit Ryouzanpaku?

00:18:15.770 --> 00:18:16.790
Does that mean,

00:18:16.790 --> 00:18:19.170
after witnessing yesterday's battle,

00:18:19.170 --> 00:18:21.820
you all have decided to end my training because I have no talent?

00:18:21.820 --> 00:18:22.860
That's right.

00:18:22.860 --> 00:18:25.320
Well, I do admit that I don't have any talents,

00:18:25.320 --> 00:18:27.830
but I can't believe you'd do something like this...

00:18:27.830 --> 00:18:28.840
That's not true, right?

00:18:29.130 --> 00:18:32.440
We can no longer afford to waste time on someone who refuses to understand its value.

00:18:32.440 --> 00:18:34.840
Master Kouetsu, are you being serious?

00:18:35.120 --> 00:18:37.960
Well I don't really mind the whole talentless issue,

00:18:37.960 --> 00:18:40.720
but I think a student with talent is still a lot better.

00:18:40.720 --> 00:18:45.290
It's supposed to be a secret that it's for your own sake.

00:18:45.980 --> 00:18:47.080
No talent. No talent. No talent. No talent...~

00:18:47.080 --> 00:18:48.100
No talent. No talent. No talent. No talent...~

00:18:48.100 --> 00:18:49.160
