00:18:59.790 --> 00:19:03.460
This fake drama is all about Yami, isn't it?

00:19:05.220 --> 00:19:06.230
So that means,

00:19:06.230 --> 00:19:08.370
now that this problem directly involves Yami,

00:19:08.370 --> 00:19:09.820
you've all decided that it would be too dangerous for me.

00:19:09.820 --> 00:19:11.330
Hence Master Kouetsu drafted this "play",

00:19:11.330 --> 00:19:13.460
and Master Ma dramatized it?

00:19:13.460 --> 00:19:16.130
No, Ma is the one who drafted...

00:19:16.130 --> 00:19:16.950
Shhh!

00:19:17.190 --> 00:19:21.750
That's why I told you all not to use any weird tricks.

00:19:21.750 --> 00:19:27.230
Everyone just wanted to protect you and thought this was the best course of action for your sake.

00:19:28.850 --> 00:19:32.180
All of you, you all know that I'm not really,

00:19:32.180 --> 00:19:35.700
going to just nod and agree with what you are planning to accomplish here, are you?

00:19:35.700 --> 00:19:37.180
Even if you totally excommunicate me,

00:19:37.180 --> 00:19:39.240
I'm not going to move an inch away from Ryouzanpaku!

00:19:40.640 --> 00:19:42.750
What a troublesome disciple.

00:19:43.200 --> 00:19:47.210
Besides, these people enjoy corrupting someone as kind as Raichi-san by dragging them into darkness.

00:19:47.210 --> 00:19:52.330
I can't ignore villains who kill people as their occupation, not to mention go as far as to hurt Miu-san!

00:19:53.200 --> 00:19:54.750
I'm going to fight them too!

00:19:56.270 --> 00:19:58.170
That was wonderful.

00:19:58.900 --> 00:20:01.110
As expected of our disciple.

00:20:01.110 --> 00:20:01.940
Not really.

00:20:01.940 --> 00:20:03.620
You've got guts.

00:20:05.660 --> 00:20:07.560
Now there is no need to doubt.

00:20:07.560 --> 00:20:13.030
Ken-chan is indeed a man already capable of choosing the place of his own death.

00:20:14.660 --> 00:20:16.540
Huh, death?

00:20:16.970 --> 00:20:23.060
I faltered a bit, but I felt relieved after hearing that our disciple is actually already prepared to die.

00:20:23.060 --> 00:20:24.080
You're right.

00:20:24.080 --> 00:20:27.360
I guess 16 years is already enough for a single lifetime.

00:20:27.360 --> 00:20:28.160
Already enough.

00:20:28.160 --> 00:20:30.190
Yami is an organization filled with,

00:20:30.340 --> 00:20:34.500
bloodthirsty beings that would even kill just to get the thrill of challenge.

00:20:34.500 --> 00:20:35.700
Kill?

00:20:35.780 --> 00:20:36.670
It is possible,

00:20:37.440 --> 00:20:40.370
that their primary target now is Ken-chan.

00:20:41.400 --> 00:20:43.540
They want to decapitate you!

00:20:45.440 --> 00:20:48.800
By the way, according to my calculations last night,

00:20:48.800 --> 00:20:50.650
with your current capabilities,

00:20:50.650 --> 00:20:53.970
you'll only survive for a maximum of three months against them.

00:20:54.490 --> 00:20:58.360
Akisame's calculations are usually pretty accurate.

00:20:58.850 --> 00:21:04.990
So, how much training do we need to add in order for him to survive against Yami's elite fighters?

00:21:04.990 --> 00:21:08.050
Unfortunately, that would have to depend on the data I will obtain from his upcoming opponent.

00:21:09.080 --> 00:21:10.760
<i>He's really calculating.</i>

00:21:10.760 --> 00:21:12.950
He's already beyond his limits,

00:21:12.950 --> 00:21:14.650
but according to the level of risk that I'm assessing,

00:21:14.650 --> 00:21:16.260
lets say, around this much.

00:21:16.580 --> 00:21:20.170
Oh, it's about three times more than what we're already doing.

00:21:21.280 --> 00:21:24.300
I'm just going to get a few things I forgot at school.

00:21:28.910 --> 00:21:30.710
It's not impossible if you think about it.

00:21:30.710 --> 00:21:33.990
Such a word does not exist in Ryouzanpaku's dictionary.

00:21:33.990 --> 00:21:34.570
Indeed.

00:21:34.570 --> 00:21:36.860
Let's give it a try and push him rigorously to test his mettle.

00:21:36.860 --> 00:21:38.880
Well, he is prepared to die anyway.

00:21:38.880 --> 00:21:40.150
That's good.

00:21:40.150 --> 00:21:42.500
So it's not impossible.

00:21:42.840 --> 00:21:45.320
Okay then, we'll start training with the first light tomorrow.

00:21:45.540 --> 00:21:49.350
Oh, and it has been a while since we saw each other, Ken-chan.

00:21:49.350 --> 00:21:50.110
And so I shall name this,

00:21:50.110 --> 00:21:52.100
The Disciple Transformation Project!

00:21:52.100 --> 00:21:54.180
No~!

00:21:57.480 --> 00:22:02.590
No time to even catch my breath, all I want to do is protect.

00:21:57.480 --> 00:22:02.590
息も出来なくてただ護りたくて

00:21:57.480 --> 00:22:02.590
Iki mo dekinakute tada mamoritakute

00:22:02.600 --> 00:22:08.770
I continue to be lost in this never-ending dream.

00:22:02.600 --> 00:22:08.770
終わりのない夢をさまよい続けるよ

00:22:02.600 --> 00:22:08.770
Owari no nai yume wo samayoi tsudukeru yo

00:22:18.280 --> 00:22:23.550
I tiptoe carefully so I can sneak away.

00:22:18.280 --> 00:22:23.550
つま先から離れて行く

00:22:18.280 --> 00:22:23.550
Tsumasaki kara hanarete yuku

00:22:23.560 --> 00:22:27.510
Time becomes something of a fleeting moment, swiftly turning into the past.

00:22:23.560 --> 00:22:27.510
時間は瞬間、過去

00:22:23.560 --> 00:22:27.510
Jikan wa shunkan, kako

00:22:28.420 --> 00:22:33.480
The blue light that I look up at,

00:22:28.420 --> 00:22:33.480
見上げている青い光

00:22:28.420 --> 00:22:33.480
Miagete iru aoi hikari

00:22:33.490 --> 00:22:38.930
is actually a star that I thought had perished long ago.

00:22:33.490 --> 00:22:38.930
もう存在しない星だとしたって

00:22:33.490 --> 00:22:38.930
Mou sonzai shinai hoshi da to shitatte

00:22:40.220 --> 00:22:43.270
Without a doubt, I know I can reach it.

00:22:40.220 --> 00:22:43.270
きっとたどり着き

00:22:40.220 --> 00:22:43.270
Kitto tadoritsuki

00:22:43.280 --> 00:22:47.530
That's why I want to get close and confirm it with my own eyes.

00:22:43.280 --> 00:22:47.530
この目で確かめたい

00:22:43.280 --> 00:22:47.530
Kono me de tashikametai

00:22:47.540 --> 00:22:50.030
This unrelenting wind,

00:22:47.540 --> 00:22:50.030
鳴り止まない風

00:22:47.540 --> 00:22:50.030
Nariyamanai kaze

00:22:50.040 --> 00:22:52.540
is followed by an impulsive hurricane.

00:22:50.040 --> 00:22:52.540
焦燥のハリケーン

00:22:50.040 --> 00:22:52.540
Shousou no HARIKEEN

00:22:52.550 --> 00:22:57.540
Yet the sky is filled with birds flying together.

00:22:52.550 --> 00:22:57.540
一斉に鳥が飛び立つ空

00:22:52.550 --> 00:22:57.540
Issei ni tori ga tobitatsu sora

00:22:57.550 --> 00:23:02.570
No time to even catch my breath, all I want to do is protect.

00:22:57.550 --> 00:23:02.570
息も出来なくてただ護りたくて

00:22:57.550 --> 00:23:02.570
Iki mo dekinakute tada mamoritakute

00:23:02.580 --> 00:23:08.970
I continue to be lost in this never-ending dream.

00:23:02.580 --> 00:23:08.970
終わりのない夢をさまよい続けるよ

00:23:02.580 --> 00:23:08.970
Owari no nai yume wo samayoi tsudukeru yo
